WEBVTT

00:01:59.282 --> 00:02:01.284
that her symptoms
have not been recognized.

00:02:01.409 --> 00:02:04.036
That’s one way that words
and pictures can work together

00:02:04.036 --> 00:02:05.413
to tell a health care story.

00:02:05.413 --> 00:02:07.165
And this is something anyone can do.

00:02:07.456 --> 00:02:09.959
You might be thinking,
“No, I’m not a comics artist.”

00:02:09.959 --> 00:02:10.960
But that’s OK.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:11.961
You don’t have to be.

00:02:11.961 --> 00:02:14.672
A health care story can benefit
from very simple pictures.

00:02:14.714 --> 00:02:16.048
I'm going to show you how,

00:02:16.048 --> 00:02:17.800
but we’ve got to go back a few years

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.511
to a time before I drew those pictures
that I just shared.

00:02:23.097 --> 00:02:25.183
My mom’s condition got worse,

00:02:25.183 --> 00:02:26.851
and we were in the hospital a lot.

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:30.980
By this time, hallucinations
and early-stage dementia made it hard